# An allowlist (S15 run contract, T3): nothing is sent to `docker build` but the lines below.
# So .env (the real API keys), .venv and the caches never reach the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# uv_build reads the README named in pyproject.toml when it installs the project.
!README.md
!src/
!config/
# What `make eval-retrieval` reads (contract m15): the golden set v0, the conflict set, and the
# stored question vectors and routes. Not the rest of eval/golden_set/.
!eval/golden_set/v0.yaml
!eval/golden_set/conflicts-v0.yaml
!eval/question_vectors/
!eval/question_routes/
**/__pycache__
